{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39689","headline":"喜侯舍人蜀中新命三首 二 · 黄滔","name":"喜侯舍人蜀中新命三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"却搜文学起吾唐，暂失都城亦未妨。\n锦里幸爲丹凤阙，幕宾徴出紫微郎。\n来时走马随中使，到日援毫定外方。\n若以掌言看谏猎，相如从此病辉光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}